. If it is also affected, it needs its own decision.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "I'll start by checking the payments service's current status and release history.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_014FrUvMDfAeHYzf5D7oo1XS", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_014V2jcGXJzP4QLaBDRLnqFv", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The name \"payments\" isn't recognized, so I'll try likely variants of the service name.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01NE5vqwhtKUhCX6qE2z6UWU", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_011X8bK6NNWEQtLZghrVL6pD", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payment-service"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_019djqLwSwVfZyzZguo61oXb", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Y6jmuh42B5TZw2zeBDicTW", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {}, "name": "list_incidents", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "`payments-api` exists and is unhealthy (v5.1.0, 18% error rate). Next I'll pull its release history.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_018XoNKTgi1xtUCNiSjCWbjj", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "payments-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "to